// Attribute purity is locality (proposal-attributes.md §3.3): a payload is
// data, never a computation, so it cannot perform an effect. A shell block is a
// host `Exec` computation, not a value — the value-fragment discipline rejects
// it before any effect could run. The executable witness that "attribute purity
// is locality".
//@ expect-diagnostic: must be a value, not a computation
@[doc(#!{ echo hi; })]
def f = 42;
